    "note": "Informational projection of the contract and receipt; only the statement and manifest are cryptographically bound.",
    "objective": "Add a manually dispatched Evidence signing workflow that runs only on main: it verifies a committed evidence bundle against the commit that introduced it with evidence-verify, signs the bundle's in-toto statement keylessly with the GitHub Actions OIDC identity using the same cosign attest-blob arguments as the core Sigstore provider, verifies that signature against the exact workflow identity and the Actions issuer, and uploads the statement and Sigstore bundle as a run artifact. This is the first real exercise of the shipped cosign path and of the certificate identity the hosted App will later trust.",
